---
---

<section class="scene scene-passage" id="passage" style="flex-direction: column;">
  <div class="legend-card left" style="top: 25%;">
    <div class="legend-portrait legend-portrait-archival">
      <img src="/images/banneker.webp" alt="Benjamin Banneker" width="80" height="80" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="legend-info">
      <div class="legend-name">Benjamin Banneker</div>
      <div class="legend-years">1731 &ndash; 1806</div>
      <div class="legend-desc">Almanac author, surveyor of Washington D.C. Proved Black intellect in an era that denied it.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline-year reveal reveal-slow" aria-hidden="true">1619</div>
  <div style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
    <div class="scene-divider reveal" style="margin-bottom: 40px;"></div>
    <p class="reveal reveal-slow font-display" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(240, 237, 230, 0.7);">
      They crossed an ocean in darkness.
    </p>

    <figure class="scene-image img-archival img-fade-edges reveal scale-in ken-burns" style="margin: 48px 0;">
      <img src="/images/slave-ship-brookes-800.webp"
           srcset="/images/slave-ship-brookes-400.webp 400w, /images/slave-ship-brookes-500.webp 500w, /images/slave-ship-brookes-800.webp 800w"
           sizes="(max-width: 540px) 100vw, (max-width: 900px) 500px, 800px"
           alt="Diagram of the slave ship Brookes, 1788"
           width="800" height="946"
           loading="lazy" style="max-height: 50vh; object-fit: contain; background: #0a0810;" />
      <figcaption>Stowage of the British slave ship Brookes, 1788. Public domain.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="chain-break reveal" style="margin: 48px 0;">
      <div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal font-body" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; opacity: 0.5; max-width: 520px;">
      Stolen from their homes. Stripped of their names, their languages, their humanity. For 246 years, they were denied not just a seat at the table &mdash; but the right to be seen as human.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal font-display" style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(200, 67, 66, 0.6); margin-top: 40px; letter-spacing: 1px;">
      They built the table. They served the table. They were never invited to sit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
